The legal text in this repository

Based on content from the Federal Register of Legislation at 28 October 2026. For the latest information on Australian
Government legislation please go to https://www.legislation.gov.au.

Source: Federal Register of Legislation (https://www.legislation.gov.au), managed by the Office of Parliamentary
Counsel. The register's terms of use (https://www.legislation.gov.au/terms-of-use) provide that, with the exception of
the Commonwealth Coat of Arms and where otherwise noted, all content on the register is provided under the Creative
Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
(legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode).

Changes made: the text of each registered compilation of the Commonwealth of Australia Constitution Act
(https://www.legislation.gov.au/C2004Q00685/latest/versions) and of each Act listed in data/titles.csv (each at
https://www.legislation.gov.au/<register ID>/latest/versions) has been split into one file per provision, with white
space, soft hyphens and non-breaking hyphens normalised, hidden template text and the compilers' "[see Note N]" marks
left out, and the history between compilations reconstructed into commits from the register's version list and the
compilations' endnotes. The Coat of Arms is not reproduced. Neither the Office of Parliamentary Counsel nor the
Commonwealth endorses this repository or its use.

